<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Acindar Q1 net $6.27 million.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Acindar Q1 net $6.27 million.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30.</p>
<p>Net $6.27 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: the company did not provide information on earnings per share.</p>
<p>At September 30 net worth stood at $326.8 million.</p>
<p>-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
